{"4260610":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Null Recall","steam_appid":4260610,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do demons possess people? Where do their psychic powers come from? Can we travel into their dimension? What does their dimension look like?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 3 hours to complete: 65% dialogue, 30% puzzle, 5% combat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 fully voiced characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >word puzzles (screenshot 2) = Read the minds of criminals to find out if they're guilty, or possessed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade mind reading powers (screenshot 7)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shooting (screenshot 5, 6) = defeat evil ghosts before they hurt more people<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >photograph ghosts (screenshot 3) as evidence for the UPCA<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >characters will react to each line of dialogue with facial expressions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~30 rooms, and interiors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weather effects: clouds, mist, rain, snow<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient music: slow tempo, muted piano, string, wind, bass, occasional drum <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why do demons possess people? Where do their psychic powers come from? Can we travel into their dimension? What does their dimension look like?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 3 hours to complete: 65% dialogue, 30% puzzle, 5% combat<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 fully voiced characters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >word puzzles (screenshot 2) = Read the minds of criminals to find out if they're guilty, or possessed.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >upgrade mind reading powers (screenshot 7)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shooting (screenshot 5, 6) = defeat evil ghosts before they hurt more people<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >photograph ghosts (screenshot 3) as evidence for the UPCA<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >characters will react to each line of dialogue with facial expressions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~30 rooms, and interiors<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >weather effects: clouds, mist, rain, snow<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient music: slow tempo, muted piano, string, wind, bass, occasional drum <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"You work for a government agency that studies the effects of demonic possessions.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4260610\/a92df86e5c2d88d6a9553746326b009d3dbb7065\/header.jpg?t=1793645204","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4260610\/da17b2c1f412a5490dcf56cbe5e66841c4f1e800\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793645204","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4260610\/da17b2c1f412a5490dcf56cbe5e66841c4f1e800\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793645204","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel core i3 (6th generation), AMD Ryzen<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><l